## Note — flags ON ≠ history auto-posted

Flipping a posting flag ON is event-driven: it makes **new** operations post. Rows created while a flag
was OFF (existing settlements, factoring advances, expenses, invoices) are **not** retroactively posted
by the flip — they must be back-posted through the existing gated poster. That back-post is normal
Tier-A money work, done + proven, never new GL math.
